 "summary": "Python-embedded hardware description language (formerly nMigen, successor of Migen): Python code builds a netlist of shaped values, signals, combinational/synchronous domains and FSMs, emitted as RTLIL/Verilog via Yosys and simulated by a built-in Python simulator.",
